  "Overview": "概览",
  "The NFG Hook Engine utilizes Xposed runtime overrides to intercept execution. In cases where targeted classes are dynamically loaded (such as split APKs, multidex, or custom classloader configurations), the engine intercepts classloader instantiation using a queue list structure, applying hooks safely without throwing ClassNotFound crashes.": "NFG Hook 引擎利用 Xposed 在运行时拦截执行。当目标类动态加载时（例如拆分 APK、多 DEX 或自定义类加载器），引擎通过队列结构拦截类加载器的实例化过程，安全应用 Hook，避免因 ClassNotFound 异常导致崩溃。",
